  "summary": "Seven candidates for Berkeley City Council seats joined former Police Accountability Board chair John 'Chip' Moore at an Oct. 6, 2026 press conference organized by Berkeley Against Mass Surveillance, denouncing the use of ALPR cameras and other mass surveillance technology in the city.",
  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "Seven candidates running in the upcoming Berkeley City Council elections denounced the use of mass surveillance technology, including automated license plate reader cameras, at a press conference held Tuesday on the steps of City Hall.",
